<title>USA: August jobless rate drops in Missouri.</title>
<headline>August jobless rate drops in Missouri.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Missouri's seasonally adjusted unemployment rate dropped to 4.3 percent in August from 4.7 percent in July, the Missouri Department of Labor and Industrial Relations announced Monday.</p>
<p>The department said an estimated 121,800 residents were unemployed in August, compared to 138,100 in July.</p>
<p>--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647</p>
</text>
